            {
                "entry_id": "017623cc-d07a-3fe0-890c-460f668f1930",
                "word": "hon",
                "pos": "intj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2dd957a0-cf92-35ea-b604-159af18e6924",
                        "entry_id": "017623cc-d07a-3fe0-890c-460f668f1930",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Representing a stereotypical French laugh."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "humorous"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e0a5c54e-f15f-4e4e-be75-fed8427da149",
                                "sense_id": "2dd957a0-cf92-35ea-b604-159af18e6924",
                                "text": "Hon hon hon, oui oui baguette!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "56e0c339-0a27-4a22-a8cb-001dac9c7fc9",
                                "sense_id": "2dd957a0-cf92-35ea-b604-159af18e6924",
                                "text": "She's right! We all talk like Maurice Chevalier! Hon hon hon!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eae00533-8fd1-4f9d-8131-f8769e921462",
                                "sense_id": "2dd957a0-cf92-35ea-b604-159af18e6924",
                                "text": "What cinephiles have missed most this spring are the cries of \"hon hon hon!\" — the bitchy sound of French laughter — bellowing from the Côte d'Azur."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0c17f78c-eaa6-4da2-84f3-244eff063932",
                                "sense_id": "2dd957a0-cf92-35ea-b604-159af18e6924",
                                "text": "[Ridley] Scott once said that forcing French accents on the stars of \"The Last Duel\" would have been \"a disaster,\" but on that count, I beg to differ. Imagine Ben Affleck winding up to crucial lines with a snooty \"a-hon-hon-hon!\" Now that you have, you won't want to go without."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "779c8ee3-de87-3d50-a7e4-83f8d17fd007",
                "word": "hon",
                "pos": "intj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dcc55f1b-cde5-3579-a278-a2834aea0285",
                        "entry_id": "779c8ee3-de87-3d50-a7e4-83f8d17fd007",
                        "glosses": [
                            "; (typically) cheering a sports team, especially a GAA team; exhortation or encouragement come on; congratulations well done, bravo."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Ireland",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "afc834a1-f6fc-41ff-a411-fb296f4f7a8f",
                                "sense_id": "dcc55f1b-cde5-3579-a278-a2834aea0285",
                                "text": "“Hon the Banner!” is the single-minded mantra being roared everywhere else."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "968fa304-b86a-439b-b268-4e69c8e23f3b",
                                "sense_id": "dcc55f1b-cde5-3579-a278-a2834aea0285",
                                "text": "We're not normally impressed by this kind of stuff but h'on the lads! This is pretty good."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e3ef4371-77b0-4be3-bc09-d9a924e21ba7",
                                "sense_id": "dcc55f1b-cde5-3579-a278-a2834aea0285",
                                "text": "To coincide with the film’s release, GQ recently enlisted the actor to take part in a photoshoot in some of Dublin’s most beloved pubs. ... Hon Dublin!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "01426c56-80b8-4a41-8b73-37d40723c0a9",
                                "sense_id": "dcc55f1b-cde5-3579-a278-a2834aea0285",
                                "text": "22:23 BIRDIE: Lowry (-2) can't find the bottom of the cup with his eagle putt but taps in for birdie. Hon the Offalyman. He's one behind the leaders, McGirt and Hoffman"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
