            {
                "entry_id": "e52cf393-1ddb-387f-9650-e6a4d688dd94",
                "word": "hon",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "e99d4285-a2a0-4358-886a-896c16b5d36c",
                        "entry_id": "e52cf393-1ddb-387f-9650-e6a4d688dd94",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "hons"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0754cfb2-e234-344e-be64-467830ad2586",
                        "entry_id": "e52cf393-1ddb-387f-9650-e6a4d688dd94",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A term of endearment; Honey, sweetheart"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2bab2d2d-d772-4a3d-ba4d-b7d28dc38159",
                                "sense_id": "0754cfb2-e234-344e-be64-467830ad2586",
                                "text": "Hey, hon! How was your day at work?"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "252985f0-bc32-3854-96da-8a466e3aaf53",
                        "entry_id": "e52cf393-1ddb-387f-9650-e6a4d688dd94",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A term of endearment; Honey, sweetheart",
                            "A friendly term of address."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Southern-US"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1f59eb13-6097-3aba-814f-dd5ba6987708",
                        "entry_id": "e52cf393-1ddb-387f-9650-e6a4d688dd94",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A trans woman who does not pass; a clocky trans woman."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory",
                            "offensive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "50b9becb-7814-4f3f-b961-a3e5266f71d8",
                                "sense_id": "1f59eb13-6097-3aba-814f-dd5ba6987708",
                                "text": "This youngshit mogs me: I'm such a hon."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1ec34cca-0490-4c71-8cc7-0ef93615ecc0",
                                "sense_id": "1f59eb13-6097-3aba-814f-dd5ba6987708",
                                "text": "If you didn't experience that you'll end up one of those ugly SJW programmer transbian hons with dyed hair sucking each other's dicks while acting like men in every way possible."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "58ef0be9-c4b5-45df-ac3b-98b799b3533b",
                                "sense_id": "1f59eb13-6097-3aba-814f-dd5ba6987708",
                                "text": "[cw anti-trans slurs] I get that they're rarer than 'trap' (being used to describe trans women as intentional deceivers) but I'd like it if people could be equally hostile to the terms 'brick' and 'hon' honestly / it's all transmisic garbage"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c6b503cb-9ac5-4f9d-8da9-4a95391e42b6",
                                "sense_id": "1f59eb13-6097-3aba-814f-dd5ba6987708",
                                "text": "'brick' refers to a trans woman who doesn't 'pass', 'hon' refers to a trans woman who doesn't pass and also is nice to other trans women who don't pass, particularly used against older trans women"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c4229b57-aaf2-4dcf-a1c1-fba1bff7c651",
                                "sense_id": "1f59eb13-6097-3aba-814f-dd5ba6987708",
                                "text": "Consider the fact that /tttt/ calls any positive trans space a hugbox full of hons. We're still hung up about passing and it's so pathetic."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aae2c581-6329-42d5-ac4c-179fee6d6eb9",
                                "sense_id": "1f59eb13-6097-3aba-814f-dd5ba6987708",
                                "text": "listen hon, if you're a \"biological boy\" that's cool and all but the rest of us are trans women."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e3824bc8-aa5e-4e59-be6a-3ca8d40b9ce7",
                                "sense_id": "1f59eb13-6097-3aba-814f-dd5ba6987708",
                                "text": "i feel like that depends on how you're using it. referring to yourself as a \"hon\", or using it as a joke, sure. but calling other trans people hons directly or indirectly is a bit far imo. it's an insult about something specific, so it's different from general slurs like \"tranny\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dd6a91f1-fd9b-4945-b919-c7d81bc97dc6",
                                "sense_id": "1f59eb13-6097-3aba-814f-dd5ba6987708",
                                "text": "It [the word \"hon\"] comes from the cliché, \"You look great, hon,\" which is often used by older transitioners who do not \"pass.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d689f4d0-98ec-4139-8474-1fa30cf3499b",
                                "sense_id": "1f59eb13-6097-3aba-814f-dd5ba6987708",
                                "text": "On TTTT, a major piece of jargon is \"hon,\" a slur used by trans women for other trans women."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f809d1e4-9c31-40c2-a3ca-816db18449ed",
                        "source_entry_id": "e52cf393-1ddb-387f-9650-e6a4d688dd94",
                        "source_sense_description": "Translations",
                        "target_lang_word": "hon",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hon",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e8ce840b-27b0-37c3-b83e-b01b813ea40a",
                                        "entry_id": "9682e576-05c7-39ff-b406-893f2d9ff8f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Cri de mécontentement. Quelquefois il se répète et s'emploie pour marquer la surprise, l'irrésolution."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9dfe5138-941b-4caf-b782-e9ae955c4a93",
                                                "sense_id": "e8ce840b-27b0-37c3-b83e-b01b813ea40a",
                                                "text": "Hon ! hon ! il a remis là à payer ses créanciers ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd748eca-b827-4ada-a1a0-ff5d7f8033e2",
                                                "sense_id": "e8ce840b-27b0-37c3-b83e-b01b813ea40a",
                                                "text": "Hé quoi donc ? les battus, ma foi, paieront l'amende ! Voyons ce qu'elle chante : hon…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ce0203d-28ec-4b1c-8768-c36596634bae",
                                                "sense_id": "e8ce840b-27b0-37c3-b83e-b01b813ea40a",
                                                "text": "— Hon ! dit en grommelant le bonhomme, j’ai les pieds dans la neige et une gouttière dans l’oreille ; j’ai le froid sur la tête et la mort dans le cœur, et tu ne me chantes que des violettes, du soleil, des herbes et de l’amour : tais-toi !"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "765872dd-8e8b-4f34-be1f-4fcb4839b4c2",
                                                "sense_id": "e8ce840b-27b0-37c3-b83e-b01b813ea40a",
                                                "text": "- C'est une demoiselle fort aimable.\n- Cela vous plaît à dire.\n- Elle est très jolie.\n- Hon !"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ec10e53-7555-4e72-aa27-f7ccaa4de6ca",
                                                "sense_id": "e8ce840b-27b0-37c3-b83e-b01b813ea40a",
                                                "text": "– Vous lancez des graviers sur la voiture, Guillaume ?\n - Hon.\n - Pourquoi faites-vous ça ? pour l’esquinter ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bcb55974-af08-33bf-93fc-64bcc6f71254",
                                        "entry_id": "9682e576-05c7-39ff-b406-893f2d9ff8f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Exclamation exprimant un attendrissement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Moderne",
                                            "Québec"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2e6b7e1-e0b9-4220-8f73-003e92e19708",
                                                "sense_id": "bcb55974-af08-33bf-93fc-64bcc6f71254",
                                                "text": "Hon!... R'garde donc les p'tites si elles sont cutes!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "hon",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
